DEATHWARD_MECHANICS 1
# id environment flame-damage-scale burning-damage-scale transform|none trigger health-policy
# Flame contact and burning status damage are distinct channels.
# Clotty article: fire immunity/ignition except flooded rooms.
# Red Candle notes: these flame transformations do not damage the monsters.
# Fractional health retention and the current DW HP/radii are explicit conversion choices.
fire_reaction 15.0.0 dry 0 0 15.3.0 both fraction
fire_reaction 15.3.0 dry 0 0 none both fraction
# Hopper article: Flaming Hopper still takes burning-status damage.
fire_reaction 29.0.0 any 0 1 54.0.0 flame fraction
fire_reaction 54.0.0 any 0 1 none flame fraction
